  "prefLabel": "Jus 401.34 Trustee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 401.34 “Trustee” means the trustee of an express trust, a municipal trustee of trust funds as described in RSA 31:22, or a library trustee as described in RSA 202-A:6–8.\n\nSource. #13455, eff 10-7-22; ss by #14162, eff 12-27-24",
